Source: kalinka-plugin-sdk
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Dmitry Savin <envelsavinds@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 9)
Standards-Version: 3.9.6
Homepage: https://github.com/madenvel/KalinkaPlayer
Package: kalinka-plugin-sdk
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10),
    python3-venv,
    python3-pip
Description: Kalinka Plugin SDK
 Software Development Kit for developing input modules and device plugins 
 for the Kalinka Player. Provides APIs and base classes for creating
 custom plugins that extend Kalinka Player functionality.
